          <rules>
            <rule name="Regimental Standard" id="e72b-932c-8756-2d5c" hidden="false">
              <description>Add +1 to the combat resolution score of any assault that takes place within 6&quot; of a Regimental Standard. If the model bearing the standard is slain in close combat then the enemy model that slew him captures the standard and the enemy gets the +1 bonus from then on. A standard can change hands several times in a single battle.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
