        <infoLink name="Steadfast" id="d239-acc6-12d7-15ad" hidden="false" targetId="ea73-5c36-49dc-dbff" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry name="Colonel-Commissar Ibram Gaunt" id="fc02-f3ac-61d8-62b0" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="b380-657c-9531-634c" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="ec45-c74c-a00c-4966" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="90"/>
          </costs>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink name="Gaunt" id="8634-bd80-2664-7b6e" hidden="false" targetId="aba6-abb5-f918-e9e1" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Camo Cloak" id="ebb3-8b85-3b79-ec5e" hidden="false" targetId="647d-f731-5d52-f8e4" type="rule"/>
            <infoLink name="Bolt Pistol" id="f20a-8bfa-5bb8-591e" hidden="false" targetId="e9ac-c779-51bb-3c9a" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Power Weapon" id="7241-ddff-5a0c-455c" hidden="false" targetId="5774-7187-2616-dd8a" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Krak Grenades" id="7854-008f-ca5d-a35a" hidden="false" targetId="9c1b-bf93-059b-27f5" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Frag Grenades" id="2fa4-6305-96ab-01f9" hidden="false" targetId="9dd4-e950-2419-5934" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Tanith Knife" id="6797-ea37-5ae7-9301" hidden="false" targetId="36d3-c20f-b78f-7bf9" type="rule"/>
            <infoLink name="Leadership" id="2f91-8299-e1a4-8f8f" hidden="false" targetId="11ff-f612-addd-577e" type="rule"/>
          </infoLinks>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Colonel-Commissar" id="f181-f8c4-9808-afe2" hidden="false">
              <description>Gaunt does not follow the normal special rules for Commissars and so is not assigned for an Officer or Sergeant, nor will he execute members of a squad that he joins. He must always be accompanied by his Command HQ.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Sword of Heironymo" id="455b-381c-dc15-303e" hidden="false">
              <description>The Sword of Heironymo is a master-crafted power sword that hits at Strenght 4.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Front Liner" id="a5b4-117a-5a91-b546" hidden="false">
              <description>If there is an assault occuring within 12&quot; of Gaunt at the start of the Imperial Guard player&apos;s turn and he is not in combat, he must immediately move towards the nearest combat in his Movement phase and assault the enemy models in that combat if at all possible. However, when Gaunt charges into an assault, he inspires such feats of heroism that all Imperial Guard models in that combat, even thsoe using supporting attacks, benefit from +1 Attack for that round only. This benefit includes Gaunt himself, and his command HQ.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Colonel Colm Corbec" id="0c6f-c4b8-8bc0-04fc" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="ab64-7a09-1d0a-717b" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="d680-565b-0414-bc05" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="44"/>
          </costs>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink name="Lasgun" id="fdcc-f2b3-b25b-c085" hidden="false" targetId="ce92-3ccf-ee54-f6b1" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Tanith Knife" id="b171-13bc-1bb1-b832" hidden="false" targetId="36d3-c20f-b78f-7bf9" type="rule"/>
            <infoLink name="Trademark Item" id="cd5d-939d-4c46-41c9" hidden="false" targetId="0630-f0bd-6da5-e593" type="rule"/>
            <infoLink name="Camo Cloak" id="a41e-5edd-dd00-31cf" hidden="false" targetId="647d-f731-5d52-f8e4" type="rule"/>
            <infoLink name="Frag Grenades" id="42e2-9ac1-eed8-5886" hidden="false" targetId="9dd4-e950-2419-5934" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Melta Bombs" id="1cae-2786-6584-4153" hidden="false" targetId="87d0-8c40-7bcb-8cbb" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Corbec" id="97c4-941a-c080-02c2" hidden="false" targetId="5d20-f9c5-0d47-27bf" type="profile"/>
          </infoLinks>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Natural Born Leader" id="1916-7875-b556-a983" hidden="false">
              <description>If Gaunt is removed as a casualty, Corbec takes over the leadership of the Tanith troops. All Leadership bases tests taken by the unit from then on use Corbec&apos;s Leadership. All units that would normally have tested on Gaunt&apos;s Headership test of Corbec&apos;s instead.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Chief Medical Officer Dorden" id="9e6a-1336-ed1c-c575" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="e3c6-b4fc-e96b-93d2" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="71eb-fc8d-3c85-1fae" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="18"/>
          </costs>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink name="Dordon" id="91ed-e0c7-c507-8bc8" hidden="false" targetId="c01a-35bb-9d90-33e4" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Laspistol" id="25a6-7887-3050-c6c8" hidden="false" targetId="95a9-d270-d218-1772" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Close Combat Weapon" id="5414-5814-2300-1ba0" hidden="false" targetId="46d5-85f2-d932-f0a2" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Frag Grenades" id="9f62-fe63-6f35-8f7e" hidden="false" targetId="9dd4-e950-2419-5934" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Camo Cloak" id="e22e-3b00-e3b2-24c9" hidden="false" targetId="647d-f731-5d52-f8e4" type="rule"/>
            <infoLink name="Medi-pack" id="d054-c0f6-5136-f7e6" hidden="false" targetId="16d3-73ab-2527-3e33" type="rule"/>
            <infoLink name="Tanith Knife" id="fb91-73ec-1640-56da" hidden="false" targetId="36d3-c20f-b78f-7bf9" type="rule"/>
          </infoLinks>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Expert Medic" id="6b7d-0f9c-052c-e0d4" hidden="false">
              <description>Dorden allows his unit to ignore both the first and second failed armor saving throw each turn. He may not use this ability if he is in base-to-base contact with any enemy models.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Oath" id="ba81-721a-20bf-17bc" hidden="false">
              <description>Dorden may not ever fire his laspistol in the Shooting phase, but may use it as a weapon in the Assault phase.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Brin Milo" id="9682-26a1-65fb-d7b5" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="3ff9-87b5-182e-ce1c" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="651e-e69c-285e-fe5f" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="42"/>
          </costs>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink name="Milo" id="9ec6-a2ea-709c-c4af" hidden="false" targetId="06ce-0aba-ce45-1e35" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Lasgun" id="e0b8-06e3-2859-f01f" hidden="false" targetId="ce92-3ccf-ee54-f6b1" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Frag Grenades" id="ae02-3e8b-e585-feda" hidden="false" targetId="9dd4-e950-2419-5934" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Tanith Knife" id="83db-6fc9-9c4b-47d2" hidden="false" targetId="36d3-c20f-b78f-7bf9" type="rule"/>
            <infoLink name="Camo Cloak" id="2ed1-c9c5-67b9-fdc3" hidden="false" targetId="647d-f731-5d52-f8e4" type="rule"/>
          </infoLinks>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Tanith Pipes" id="a346-a7a2-d0c9-07c5" hidden="false">
              <description>The Tanith Pipes act as a Regimental Standard, although it cannot be captured by the enemy. However, if Milo is killed all Tanith troops (including Gaunt) are at -1 Leadership for the rest of the game.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Precognition" id="c49c-57c6-430a-2dd6" hidden="false">
              <description>Milo has a 4+ Invulnerable save, and confers it to Gaunt if he is within 2&quot; of him.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Master Sniper Mad Larkin" id="8725-c8d7-2fc7-ea9d" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="cfab-86ac-4363-2362" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="6a4e-bfda-feba-64ed" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="37"/>
          </costs>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink name="Frag Grenades" id="9ad0-5b5d-d74a-2eca" hidden="false" targetId="9dd4-e950-2419-5934" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Lasgun" id="7a82-9130-4c98-694a" hidden="false" targetId="ce92-3ccf-ee54-f6b1" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Sniper Rifle" id="0d9b-600c-abb3-146d" hidden="false" targetId="3825-4a6b-6aaa-8c99" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Camo Cloak" id="df8e-f041-65d1-1977" hidden="false" targetId="647d-f731-5d52-f8e4" type="rule"/>
            <infoLink name="Larkin" id="9987-ff32-48e4-2591" hidden="false" targetId="b0fb-17ed-3ca8-2609" type="profile"/>
          </infoLinks>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Marksman" id="90b2-eb70-d3bf-d8d9" hidden="false">
              <description>Larkin nominates a model when he is shooting, such as a Sergeant or a Heavy Weapons trooper. This means he gets to choose which model is removed as a casualty, not the enemy. In addition, Larkin can target any model in range and line of sight, regardless of any targetting restrictions. In addition, Larkin may move and fire his weapon.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Customised Long-Las" id="5b03-a129-2cb5-1469" hidden="false">
              <description>Larkin always hits on a 2+ and wounds on a 4+, rerolling any failed rolls to wound. The long-las has a range of 36&quot; and an AP value of 6, but on the roll of a 5+ to hit it ignores all cover and armour saves.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Try Again Bragg" id="dc74-dac1-b893-8a01" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
          <comment>https://web.archive.org/web/20070124114945/http://uk.games-workshop.com/imperialguard/gaunts-ghosts/</comment>
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="81fd-19f1-eabf-9413" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="70b1-87bb-78c6-c8c8" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="23"/>
          </costs>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink name="Bragg" id="bfd1-e833-cb4b-24a9" hidden="false" targetId="4faf-4c4d-1116-df81" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Heavy Bolter" id="c27d-2f22-bea4-40dc" hidden="false" targetId="b9aa-366b-bd62-4692" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Frag Grenades" id="39c0-f79c-fc78-8c19" hidden="false" targetId="9dd4-e950-2419-5934" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Camo Cloak" id="12dc-59a2-acea-b144" hidden="false" targetId="647d-f731-5d52-f8e4" type="rule"/>
          </infoLinks>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Brawn" id="fa77-d54e-069c-23ff" hidden="false">
              <description>Bragg is almost legendarily strong. He may move and fire with his heavy bolter, although this does nothing for his already shoddy accuracy...</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Major Rawne" id="056b-9185-0c87-2589" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
          <comment>https://web.archive.org/web/20070124114945/http://uk.games-workshop.com/imperialguard/gaunts-ghosts/</comment>
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="e31e-06c8-0716-19de" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="0fd6-df01-3ab3-9955" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="23"/>
          </costs>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink name="Rawne" id="49d1-b817-6669-8dea" hidden="false" targetId="3bc6-3751-dde1-a816" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Lasgun" id="79ab-0e2c-7543-b098" hidden="false" targetId="ce92-3ccf-ee54-f6b1" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Frag Grenades" id="dc78-c9d9-2f4e-b307" hidden="false" targetId="9dd4-e950-2419-5934" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Demolition Charge" id="529f-3a54-436a-4579" hidden="false" targetId="60f0-36e3-b539-71ac" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Camo Cloak" id="5eef-6dd0-d503-65fa" hidden="false" targetId="647d-f731-5d52-f8e4" type="rule"/>
          </infoLinks>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Grudge" id="4786-6965-8833-5e8a" hidden="false">
              <description>At the start of every Imperial Guard Assault phase, if the squad ever comprises of only Gaunt and Major Rawne and they are not already in close combat, Rawne must pass a Leadership test or will attack Gaunt as if he were an enemy model until one of them is removed as a casualty. The survivor may act normally from that point onward.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Sergeant Mkoll" id="8639-086e-c5d2-314e" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
          <comment>https://web.archive.org/web/20070124114945/http://uk.games-workshop.com/imperialguard/gaunts-ghosts/</comment>
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="24be-90dc-75d2-a582" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="21a9-c9d2-b361-c296" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="23"/>
          </costs>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink name="Lasgun" id="b304-8b15-61a7-ea8d" hidden="false" targetId="ce92-3ccf-ee54-f6b1" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Frag Grenades" id="521d-f1d6-0c22-65b9" hidden="false" targetId="9dd4-e950-2419-5934" type="profile"/>
            <infoLink name="Camo Cloak" id="5dfd-4139-0870-9a7e" hidden="false" targetId="647d-f731-5d52-f8e4" type="rule"/>
          </infoLinks>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Peerless Scout" id="bf91-be22-6b9e-3852" hidden="false">
              <description>Mkoll may be detached from Gaunt&apos;s retinue to lead a squad of Tanith troops (Tanith Hardened Veterans or Tanith Infantry). Mkoll and any unit he leads may re-roll any failed cover saves; the second result must be applied. They may deploy in Ambush (as detailed on page 20 of Codex Catachans), or as normal Infiltrators if the controlling player wishes and if the Infiltrators special rule is being used. If Mkoll is spotted by or attacks a Sentry model, the alarm is only raised on the D6 roll of a 6. Mkoll doubles his Initiative when in combat with Sentries.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Acute Perception" id="07d9-cd59-8075-bf82" hidden="false">
              <description>Mkoll is adept at picking out anomalies in the landscape and can scan an area for Ambushes, Booby Traps and Lictors as if he was equipped with an Auspex (see pages 20/21 of Codex: Catachans)</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
      </selectionEntries>
    </selectionEntry>
